==Season summary==
Celtic won the title to stop Rangers' bid for [[Nine in a row|10 league championships in a row]], and won the Scottish League Cup. Manager [[Wim Jansen]] resigned at the end of the season, to be replaced by [[Jozef Vengloš]].

